            "title": "Base Version",
            "description": "The diagnosis `version` the doctor was looking at. Required once the diagnosis has been validated: changing a validation without it is 409 `validation_exists`, and with an older one 409 `version_conflict`. Optional for the first validation of a pending diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "status"
        ],
        "title": "DiagnosisValidationPatch",
        "description": "PATCH /diagnoses/{id}/status: the verdict plus the version it was made on.\n\nSync carries the version on the op (`base_version`), so this field exists\nonly on the REST body."
      },
